1
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:19,220
Ma sœur attend un bébé : la naissance est prévue en juin.
My sister is expecting a baby: the birth is planned for June.

2
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:24,524
Félicitations ! Elle va accoucher à Paris ?
Congratulations! Is she going to give birth in Paris?

3
00:00:24,624 --> 00:00:28,412
Oui, et le bébé va naître à Paris.
Yes, and the baby is going to be born in Paris.

4
00:00:28,512 --> 00:00:34,820
Mon cousin va se marier samedi. Le mariage est à la mairie.
My cousin is getting married on Saturday. The wedding is at city hall.

5
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:40,484
C'est super ! Mes grands-parents parlent de la retraite.
That's great! My grandparents are talking about retirement.

6
00:00:40,584 --> 00:00:46,532
Mes voisins vont divorcer. Leur divorce est difficile.
My neighbors are going to get divorced. Their divorce is difficult.

7
00:00:46,632 --> 00:00:50,780
Ils cherchent un appartement après leur déménagement.
They're looking for an apartment after their move.

8
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:58,076
Je comprends. Quelle année : une grossesse, un mariage et la retraite !
I understand. What a year: a pregnancy, a wedding, and retirement!
